tarcin keys — esc or q closes this screen                                                                               
                                                                                                                        
Everywhere                                                                                                              
  :                      command line                                                                                   
  tab                    next pane                                                                                      
  shift+tab              previous pane                                                                                  
  ?                      show this help                                                                                 
  ] u                    next unread chat                                                                               
  [ u                    previous unread chat                                                                           
  ctrl+q                 quit                                                                                           
  ctrl+k, /              search chats                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
Chat list and messages                                                                                                  
  G, end                 bottom (newest)                                                                                
  j, down                down                                                                                           
  ctrl+d                 half a page down                                                                               
  ctrl+u                 half a page up                                                                                 
  ctrl+f, pgdown         page down                                                                                      
  ctrl+b, pgup           page up                                                                                        
  g g, home              top                                                                                            
  k, up                  up                                                                                             
                                                                                                                        
Chat list                                                                                                               
  enter, l               open chat                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
Messages                                                                                                                
  i, a                   write a message                                                                                
  y                      copy text                                                                                      
  d d                    delete                                                                                         
  e                      edit your message                                                                              
  f                      forward                                                                                        
  g q                    jump to quoted message                                                                         
  g x                    open a link (again: the next)                                                                  
  o                      open media                                                                                     
  r                      react                                                                                          
  R                      reply                                                                                          
  ctrl+r                 send a failed message again                                                                    
  s                      save media                                                                                     
  v                      read in $PAGER                                                                                 
 HELP  online                                                                                                    ? help 
